	(text "BMDC3 2 MB RAM interposer: CY7C1049G (512K x 8, 36-SOJ) on the 32-SOJ site of U8..U11.\nNet names = host signal names. Address and data lines are permuted (see README table);\ncontrols and power are not. A17/A18 come from 68030 A19/A20 by wire (TP1/TP2); JP1/JP2 stay open\nunless the card is verified to drive A19/A20 on castellations 30/1. Firmware: patch_bmdc_ram.py --max 16M."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
